Instances of multiple sequence alignment, in the FASTA format (.tfa).

balibase/  the files of msa/BAliBASE of
           https://github.com/jinnaiyuu/combinatorial_instances, sequences
           of BAliBASE 3.0 (J. D. Thompson, P. Koehl, R. Ripp and O. Poch,
           "BAliBASE 3.0: latest developments of the multiple sequence
           alignment benchmark", Proteins 61, 2005), as selected there.
easy/      the files of BAliBASE/easy of
           https://github.com/jinnaiyuu/Hash-Distributed-Astar, short
           sequences cut from the same benchmark.

